      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Postman Guide\n\nA Postman collection provided to the UAE Open Finance ecosystem to help LFIs and TPPs test their API implementations against the Open Finance Trust Framework. The collection covers the full sandbox flow — TPP registration, consent, authorization, and payments — and can be downloaded pre-configured for your application from the Getting Started page. The two.postman_collection.json files at the root of the repository are the published surface — import either one into Postman to start using it.",
